7. Security & Optimization Measures
Fraud Report Rate Limiting: The matching check checks document structures within user_reports before letting a user flag a number again. This completely stops users from spamming a number to falsely raise its risk level.

Data Minimization: Local devices only query single document keys corresponding exactly to incoming caller IDs. The app never downloads full fraud directory tables, saving user network data and device battery.

Offline Support: Native Firestore capabilities enable disk caching. Known fraudulent callers logged previously remain identifiable even if the user drops cell service or loses internet access.

